<title>ZIMBABWE: ZIMBABWE MAY CPI SLIPS TO 20.7 PCT YR/YR.</title>
<headline>ZIMBABWE MAY CPI SLIPS TO 20.7 PCT YR/YR.</headline>
<dateline>HARARE 1997-06-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Zimbabwe's all-items consumer</p>
<p>price index slipped one percent in May from April, bringing the</p>
<p>year-on-year rate to 20.7 percent, the Central Statistical</p>
<p>Office said.</p>
<p>				    May 1997    April 1997  May 1996</p>
<p>Year-on-year pct change     +20.7	 +22.4	 +24.7</p>
<p>All-items index		 485.8	 490.9	 402.3</p>
<p>Food-only index		 676.6	 701.7	 546.2</p>
<p>NOTE - Index base 1990=100</p>
<p>-- Harare newsroom: +2634 72 52 27/8/9.</p>
</text>
